Third-party material

Per-file asset attribution (author, source, license) is maintained in ASSETS.md and ATTRIBUTION.md.
Every asset committed to this repository is checked by `cargo xtask assets` (part of `cargo xtask ci`).

Builds made with optional bundled fonts (`CURVEBOOK_FONTS_DIR`) embed SIL Open Font License 1.1
font faces from `$CURVEBOOK_FONTS_DIR/fonts/` and ship their license texts alongside the release
packages as `OFL-<family>.txt`. Builds without `CURVEBOOK_FONTS_DIR` embed none of them.

## Attributed Source Code

CurveBook adapts permissively licensed (MIT OR Apache-2.0) pure-egui widget helpers and top-bar
fitting logic from VectorCraft (https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft,
commit 644f5bc8e377730d093ac5af8967dcd055051a16):

- crates/ui-egui/src/widgets/toggles.rs -> crates/ui-egui/src/egui_shell/widgets.rs
